{"schema_version": 1, "segment_epoch": 1791629340, "covers_from": "2026-10-10T10:49:00+00:00", "covers_to": "2026-10-10T10:50:00+00:00", "next_epoch": 1791629400, "schedule": [{"starts_at": "2026-10-10T10:49:00+00:00", "duration_seconds": 5, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 38122, "sprite_key": "squirrel_culture", "district": "zhongshan", "topic": "交通", "content": "三重進入台北 那一段很塞", "display_name": "中山代表 No.38,122", "mood": "angry", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-10T10:49:05+00:00", "duration_seconds": 14, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 18176, "sprite_key": "squirrel_oldtown", "district": "zhongzheng", "topic": "交通", "content": "最近喜歡騎腳踏車，才發現在台北市騎腳踏車體驗很差，不是擔心撞到行人，就是擔心被車撞", "display_name": "中正代表 No.18,176", "mood": "worried", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-10T10:49:19+00:00", "duration_seconds": 6, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 8533, "sprite_key": "penguin_oldtown", "district": "zhongzheng", "topic": "教育", "content": "我不要免費營養午餐，我要美味營養的午餐", "display_name": "中正代表 Shih YuN Chang", "mood": "angry", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-10T10:49:25+00:00", "duration_seconds": 15, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 3167, "sprite_key": "bear_suburb", "district": "shilin", "topic": "經濟", "content": "臺北有好多商圈以前人潮很多例如師大、東區、士林夜市 但近幾年已經沒有往日的人潮，店面都貼租或售的牌子", "display_name": "士林代表 No.3,167", "mood": "worried", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-10T10:49:40+00:00", "duration_seconds": 15, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 57691, "sprite_key": "leopardcat_suburb", "district": "shilin", "topic": "環境", "content": "我想知道台北市能不能朝向里山來進行規劃，一種人與自然和諧共生，保護生物多樣性及促進地方永續發展", "display_name": "士林代表 楊惠", "mood": "caring", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-10T10:49:55+00:00", "duration_seconds": 5, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 6255, "sprite_key": "squirrel_culture", "district": "songshan", "topic": "交通", "content": "不希望腳踏車或機車騎上人行道上", "display_name": "松山代表 No.6,255", "mood": "helpless", "is_replay": true}], "queue": [{"position": 1, "queue_numb